l,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["拉麵整體味道不錯，裝飾用辣椒不會辣，不過麵體沒有吸到湯的感覺，所以單吃麵會覺得沒什麼味道，要多配湯汁。雞肉非常嫩很加分。\n給吃辣的人：這一點也不辣，給不吃辣的人：千萬別點。\n後續大概加了三四次辣粉補足心目中的辣味。\n雞肉叉燒好吃，不到驚艷但cp值不錯。配上拉麵濃郁湯汁很爽。\n店員很有耐心，感覺大家問的都是一樣的問題，例如沒有廁所之類，包含我也是那個沒看標示的人，不過或許文案需要更簡潔大家才能注意到。\n週日大概18:00進來點餐，當下人不太多還有約莫5個空位，但大概到18:30外面開始排隊。座位就是偏擁擠的拉麵餐廳設計，不適合多人聚餐。\n雖然餐點算日式，但外觀設計偏華式、放的音樂也是華文流行類，氣氛上有點一半一半，更適合單純用餐而非打卡踩點。",null,[0,107]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDA5VVRqTk5SVEY2VmtSVmVGWkdWa0paTUd4NFlqRTRNMXBZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDA5VVRqTk5SVEY2VmtSVmVGWkdWa0paTUd4NFlqRTRNMXBZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDA5VVRqTk5SVEY2VmtSVmVGWkdWa0paTUd4NFlqRTRNMXBZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDA5VVRqTk5SVEY2VmtSVmVGWkdWa0paTUd4NFlqRTRNMXBZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDA5VVRqTk5SVEY2VmtSVmVGWkdWa0paTUd4NFlqRTRNMXBZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRLVDA5VVRqTk5SVEY2VmtSVmVGWkdWa0paTUd4NFlqRTRNMXBZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,13078,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKT09UTjNNRTF6VkRVeFZGVkJZMGx4YjE4M1pYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x68264473ad8a76d1!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkJOOTN3ME1zVDUxVFVBY0lxb183ZXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKT09UTjNNRTF6VkRVeFZGVkJZMGx4YjE4M1pYYxAB\u0026t\u003d