jUuMLss9eWAxWom68BHe5JAzQQ3YcHCN8BKAA"]],1],null,null,"預訂網址",null,"0ahUKEwjUuMLss9eWAxWom68BHe5JAzQQ3IcHCN4BKAc",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_QUIET"],"安靜，適合交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjUuMLss9eWAxWom68BHe5JAzQQ3YcHCOEBKAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwjUuMLss9eWAxWom68BHe5JAzQQ3IcHCOABKAg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這一間是朋友介紹所以過來吃的。 當天大概晚上6點多的時候到店裡前面大概還有5組的客人，不過稍微等一下就到我們了。在等待的過程中，店員會給你號碼牌跟菜單可以先點餐。\n\n點了泡系松露雞白湯+胡麻水蓮，總共NT$340，胡麻水蓮當前菜，我覺得還挺不錯的，我覺得還算蠻好吃的。拉麵的味道我覺得算是我近期吃到的拉麵中表現最好的，真的還蠻好吃的，還蠻特別的味道，第一次吃到這種味道，我真的覺得還挺不錯的。非常推薦點這碗泡系松露雞白湯拉麵，真的很好吃。\n\n結論我覺得單以拉麵的味道就是會讓我想再回訪的店了，真的很頂。結帳只有現金稍微沒那麼方便，不過我覺得味道已經掩蓋其他的缺點了，真的非常推薦來體驗試試看。",null,[0,81]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR2ZDFSdFpIaGlTRVYzVDBVMVdFOUhXbmRrYWxreVdsYzFNV0V4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR2ZDFSdFpIaGlTRVYzVDBVMVdFOUhXbmRrYWxreVdsYzFNV0V4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR2ZDFSdFpIaGlTRVYzVDBVMVdFOUhXbmRrYWxreVdsYzFNV0V4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR2ZDFSdFpIaGlTRVYzVDBVMVdFOUhXbmRrYWxreVdsYzFNV0V4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR2ZDFSdFpIaGlTRVYzVDBVMVdFOUhXbmRrYWxreVdsYzFNV0V4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14695423177728195832/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR2ZDFSdFpIaGlTRVYzVDBVMVdFOUhXbmRrYWxreVdsYzFNV0V4UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2778,["https://www.google.com/maps/revi